  it('未开跑角色（反查空清单）→ 切该 tab 呈 transcript-empty「（暂无该会话转录）」、零进一步查询', async () => {
    sessionsFixture = {
      'test-change/implement/executor/2': [
        transcriptSession('ses-exec-2', 'test-change/implement/executor/2'),
